cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Maneuver Ledger results or code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Maneuver Ledger: Starlink collision-avoidance burns against public orbit data"
abstract: >-
  Maneuver Ledger looks for Starlink collision-avoidance burns in public orbit
  data (CelesTrak GP and SupGP element sets recorded by DODGE) and reconciles
  them, as rates, with the avoidance manoeuvres SpaceX reported to the FCC. It
  measures the detection limit with passive debris, injected burns and
  synthetic histories, and bounds how many avoidance burns of a given size the
  public data could be hiding.
